  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "50575311",
      "title": "What is RAG?",
      "lectureOrder": 394,
      "videoOrder": 393,
      "sourceHash": "fc03a18b2eebe3ae0116cb45eef687bded71edc2c15edd5469c6385d740bf9b9",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 3.24,
          "end": 10.4,
          "en": "Now it's time to move forward with a topic called Rag, which stands for Retrieval Augmented Generation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 10.76,
          "end": 16.4,
          "en": "Now see, when I talk about AI, in fact specifically gen AI, and we are using spring spring AI to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.64,
          "end": 22.44,
          "en": "talk to the models and generate data right now when it say generation, basically what happens is and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 22.44,
          "end": 28.04,
          "en": "we have discussed that before, all these models, which are your LLM models or the foundation models?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 28.04,
          "end": 30.4,
          "en": "They have been trained, of course they are models.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.4,
          "end": 32.72,
          "en": "And then we got I mean, they got training.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.88,
          "end": 38.68,
          "en": "And then when you ask a question to it, of course it will try to answer that depend upon what you're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.72,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "asking and what knowledge it has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.2,
          "end": 42.64,
          "en": "And it works okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.68,
          "end": 43.4,
          "en": "It works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.76,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "But there are certain problems with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 50.24,
          "en": "The first one is when you train a particular model, you train it for a particular date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.36,
          "end": 55.24,
          "en": "So when ChatGPT came into picture, it was trained 2 to 3 years before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.44,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "And then I mean, they had the data of three years back, not the recent one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 64.04,
          "en": "Even now when they are training, we don't have the latest information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 64.6,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 64.64,
          "end": 67,
          "en": "I mean, I'm not saying ChatGPT, I'm saying OpenAI models.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.1,
          "end": 69.14,
          "en": "That's the first one, which is they are not up to date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.14,
          "end": 70.7,
          "en": "The second one is hallucination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.7,
          "end": 74.74,
          "en": "So basically when you ask a question, it tries to give you the answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 79.7,
          "en": "And if you don't, if they don't have a proper answer, they just create certain things so that you'll",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 80.38,
          "en": "be happy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.38,
          "end": 83.74,
          "en": "And that's hallucination it the data may not be correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.74,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "And that's a big, big issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.58,
          "end": 86.02,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.06,
          "end": 90.46000000000001,
          "en": "And third, what if you want to share your own data example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.46000000000001,
          "end": 95.14,
          "en": "Let's say if I'm talking about this particular application in which you got this file, which is product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.14,
          "end": 96.22,
          "en": "details, right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.25999999999999,
          "end": 103.22,
          "en": "And if you remember in the OpenAI controller, we do have one particular API which says get answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.53999999999999,
          "end": 108.82,
          "en": "So if a user sends a message, whatever the message is, we will generate the response and send it back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.82,
          "end": 109.53999999999999,
          "en": "to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 111.14,
          "en": "And this is get answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.3,
          "end": 115.74000000000001,
          "en": "Now of course, a user can ask any question which goes to the LM and you will get the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.02000000000001,
          "end": 125.06,
          "en": "But what if I want to create a question answer page or a chatbot where whenever a user asks a question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.06,
          "end": 127.46,
          "en": "I don't want to basically give any answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 127.46,
          "end": 130.26,
          "en": "I want to very specific regarding this product details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.26,
          "end": 135.03,
          "en": "So if a user says I want to travel somewhere, so it should suggest this particular product there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.07,
          "end": 135.27,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.31,
          "end": 136.31,
          "en": "So whatever it can be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.31,
          "end": 141.67000000000002,
          "en": "So based on the context it should go to this file and give the answer for this specific file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 141.82999999999998,
          "end": 142.82999999999998,
          "en": "That's what I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.87,
          "end": 148.15,
          "en": "And this is where rag comes into picture which is retrieval augmented generation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 148.15,
          "end": 149.71,
          "en": "So of course you have your prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.71,
          "end": 151.07,
          "en": "So user will send the prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.07,
          "end": 154.19,
          "en": "You have your models instead of just sending a prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.19,
          "end": 156.47,
          "en": "We should also provide a context right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 158.87,
          "en": "And the way you can do that is with the help of Rag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 162.07,
          "en": "In fact let me just show you what I'm talking about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.07,
          "end": 165.63,
          "en": "So I'm running this application and we are going to hit this particular API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.63,
          "end": 169.19,
          "en": "And if I go to insomnia and create a new request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 171.07,
          "en": "So let's say I'm asking this particular question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.07,
          "end": 173.91,
          "en": "Need details regarding the art kit for kids.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.95,
          "end": 177.35,
          "en": "Now if you observe we do have this product mentioned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 180.67,
          "en": "There is a product which is Art supplies kit for kids.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.83,
          "end": 183.39,
          "en": "But if I click on send, of course it will work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.39,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "But then you will not get data from the file which you have passed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 188.07,
          "en": "It will send the request to the lab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.07,
          "end": 189.11,
          "en": "And that's how it works, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.11,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "That's what we have coded for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.51,
          "end": 194.35,
          "en": "So it will go to them and say, okay, you can get all these things for the kids, okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.39,
          "end": 196.51,
          "en": "But I want to be very specific with this data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.51,
          "end": 201.13,
          "en": "So what you can do is so you take this document and then you save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.13,
          "end": 202.17000000000002,
          "en": "In fact, we have seen that before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.17000000000002,
          "end": 207.09,
          "en": "You take this document, create different chunks of it and then convert it into numbers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.09,
          "end": 209.65,
          "en": "You do the embedding and you store it in the vector data store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.65,
          "end": 212.97,
          "en": "So when a user sends a request, you have to also add the context to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.97,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "And that's your chunks which you have created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.05,
          "end": 217.17000000000002,
          "en": "And this request goes to LM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 220.09,
          "en": "So it will give a proper response in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.09,
          "end": 221.69,
          "en": "And also it will not hallucinate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.13,
          "end": 224.49,
          "en": "Example if you ask a weird question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.49,
          "end": 226.97,
          "en": "So let's say tell me a joke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.01,
          "end": 228.97,
          "en": "Of course we don't have any products regarding this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.97,
          "end": 231.41,
          "en": "So when you click on send it will tell you a joke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.41,
          "end": 233.37,
          "en": "But at this point it should hallucinate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.61,
          "end": 234.77,
          "en": "Okay, that's what I wanted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 238.49,
          "en": "Or maybe I want to know the order status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.49,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "Click on send and you can see it is giving you this, but not with our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 245.97,
          "en": "So to check the status of the order, please visit the website of the retailer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.01,
          "end": 248.09,
          "en": "Okay, so it has no idea what we are doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.09,
          "end": 252.73,
          "en": "So what we'll do is we'll implement Rag here and certain things we have already done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.13,
          "end": 256.25,
          "en": "One of the thing is we have created a vector database using that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.25,
          "end": 259.05,
          "en": "So we got vector store in which you have all these details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.05,
          "end": 261.77,
          "en": "We have done the embedding and stored it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.81,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "Now we just have to fetch it okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.65,
          "end": 264.49,
          "en": "And how do we do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.49,
          "end": 266.25,
          "en": "Let's see in the next video.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
